BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//EAS-4-TbSync//timezone round-trip test//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
BEGIN:VTIMEZONE
TZID:America/New_York
BEGIN:DAYLIGHT
TZOFFSETFROM:-0500
TZOFFSETTO:-0400
TZNAME:EDT
DTSTART:19700308T020000
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=3;BYDAY=2SU
END:DAYLIGHT
BEGIN:STANDARD
TZOFFSETFROM:-0400
TZOFFSETTO:-0500
TZNAME:EST
DTSTART:19701101T020000
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=11;BYDAY=1SU
END:STANDARD
END:VTIMEZONE
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tbsync-tz-1-allday-single@example.invalid
DTSTAMP:20260801T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260915
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260916
SUMMARY:TZ1 all-day single — expect 15 Sep
DESCRIPTION:No zone must ever travel with this. Regression check on the path
 the 16.1 fix deliberately left alone.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tbsync-tz-2-allday-span@example.invalid
DTSTAMP:20260801T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260921
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260924
SUMMARY:TZ2 all-day span — expect 21-23 Sep inclusive
DESCRIPTION:DTEND is exclusive\, so the last day is 23 Sep. A single-day event
 would hide an off-by-one at the end boundary. OWA shows the exclusive end\, so
 it may read 21-24 Sep there.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tbsync-tz-3-allday-until@example.invalid
DTSTAMP:20260801T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260910
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260911
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;UNTIL=20260917
SUMMARY:TZ3 all-day series UNTIL — expect 8 days\, 10-17 Sep
DESCRIPTION:The UNTIL fix. A floating DATE converted through the host zone
 became 20261116T230000Z\, ending the series a day early for anyone east of
 UTC. The last occurrence must be 17 Sep\, not 16 Sep.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tbsync-tz-4-dst-series@example.invalid
DTSTAMP:20260801T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261013T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261013T160000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;COUNT=6
SUMMARY:TZ4 weekly 15:00 New York — expect 21:00 Berlin except 27 Oct = 20:00
DESCRIPTION:The reported bug. The EU leaves DST on 25 Oct 2026\, the US on
 1 Nov\, so exactly one occurrence differs. If all six read 21:00 the authoring
 zone was lost and the series got anchored to the local zone.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tbsync-tz-5-series-exception@example.invalid
DTSTAMP:20260801T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260908T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260908T120000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;COUNT=4
SUMMARY:TZ5 weekly 11:00 New York — expect 17:00 Berlin
DESCRIPTION:Master of the series whose third occurrence is overridden below.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tbsync-tz-5-series-exception@example.invalid
DTSTAMP:20260801T120000Z
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260922T110000
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260922T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260922T150000
SUMMARY:TZ5 moved occurrence — expect 22 Sep at 20:00 Berlin
DESCRIPTION:Pushed as its own per-instance <Change> on 16.1\, which is the path
 that newly carries its own TimeZone blob.
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
